---
title: Shared contracts · facts, authority, and outcomes
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant producer as Producer · adapter or SDK
  participant cp as Control plane
  participant target as Command target
  participant model as Model role

  producer->>cp: Event · source + occurrence + receipt
  Note over cp: A recorded fact. Deduplicate by message_id,<br/>then sequence it in its lifecycle stream.
  par Command path
    Note over cp,target: A legal transition authorizes one operation.<br/>command_id is the idempotency boundary.
    cp->>target: Command · scope + deadline + revision
    target-->>cp: Result · execution outcome: accepted, progress, terminal
  and Job path
    cp->>model: Job · analyze, as durable work + attempts
    Note over model: Lease and retry checkpoint
    model-->>cp: Model proposal · bundle + model + sources
  end
  Note over cp: Freshness check: reconcile each Result and validate<br/>each proposal's dependencies against current context and authority.
  alt revisions still current
    cp->>cp: commit the next legal transition
  else stale or late
    cp->>cp: reject · late results cannot revive work
  end
